{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（15日）早上8時47分，警方接獲多人報案求助，指黃大仙下邨龍光樓發生火警，一個單位起火及冒出濃煙，據報一度傳出爆炸聲。消防到場，出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，並於約29分鐘後將火救熄。事件中50人須緊急疏散；一名65歲婦人懷疑吸入濃煙不適。人員經初步調查，懷疑因雜物起火肇禍。消防將火救熄後，在起火單位發現一具屍體。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198574597008527360605379.jpeg/3RmUg1QnywKNabZQPSccToUNDnV7YlQUEdopzTTaKc0\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事單位外牆熏黑。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198611750300291072642817.jpeg/9Q-9zvM7NSKSCT3MkgYnd9ruRcihV6ZGR0Na52JDWuc\"/><figcaption>涉事單位外牆熏黑。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事單位熏黑。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198574259484495872427308.jpeg/26t90eNb6egzo0KPV20hHlfAPPWmJ88wEaWObjSljm4\"/><figcaption>涉事單位熏黑。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198574262127038464710845.jpeg/s1SoNvbUjOIeMo4ME-Kdkjf3uBsgSSXGjNpYZKnaWGQ\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"居民緊急疏散。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198574264803135488807436.jpeg/gSrjowDzY2XuyyAkWNYwS4LydZJe4d6FlHeigbF3ooE\"/><figcaption>居民緊急疏散。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方協助居民離開。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198574267575701504439675.jpeg/R1Q4Tpsb_S_nI_DzrQxehtrbSJi6tH4WXdQRJnjUESY\"/><figcaption>警方協助居民離開。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"居民緊急疏散。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198574258402365440251843.jpeg/mVPNMRO_XcSXx3TX77FmzHEmweGJ5JYJpfKaGYDymhk\"/><figcaption>居民緊急疏散。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198574261212680192072451.jpeg/4msVWr-ANKmlhwfuEn5_NmrsWdPfvO_DVoaGgHOGhoA\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大仙下邨龍光樓一個單位冒出濃煙。（Alex Ox ChamkinGs/黃大仙區友(黃大仙，新蒲崗，